  "solution": "The pattern followed here is:\n\nWe have to interchanged the numbers to make the given equation correct.\n\n**Given: **72 + (7 × 8) - (126 ÷ 14) - (4)2 = 150\n\n**Option 1) **72 and 126\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get the;\n\n⇒ 126 + __**(7 × 8)**__ - __**(72 ÷ 14)**__ - __**(4)**____**2**__ = 150\n\n⇒ __**126 + 56**__ - 5.14 - 16 = 150\n\n⇒ __**182 - 5.14 - 16**__ = 150\n\n⇒ 160.86 ≠ 150\n\n⇒ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\n**Option 2) **7 and 4\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get the;\n\n⇒ 72 + __**(4 × 8)**__ - __**(126 ÷ 14)**__ - __**(7)**____**2**__ = 150\n\n⇒ __**72 + 32**__ - 9 - 49 = 150\n\n⇒ __**104 - 9 - 49**__ = 150\n\n⇒ 46 ≠ 150\n\n⇒ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\n**Option 3) **8 and 4\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get the;\n\n⇒ 72 + __**(7 × 4)**__ - __**(126 ÷ 14) **__- __**(8)**____**2**__ = 150\n\n⇒ __**72 + 28**__ - 9 - 64 = 150\n\n⇒ __**100 - 9 - 64**__ = 150\n\n⇒ 27 ≠ 150\n\n⇒ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\n**Option 4) **14 and 7\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get the;\n\n⇒ 72 + __**(14 × 8)**__ - __**(126 ÷ 7)**__ - __**(4)**____**2**____** **__= 150\n\n⇒ __**72 + 112 **__- 18 - 16 = 150\n\n⇒ __**184 - 18 - 16**__ = 150\n\n⇒ 150 = 150\n\n⇒ **LHS = RHS**\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"Option 4\".**",
